  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/sweep-thousands-of-leases-for-compliance-using-amazon-quick-and-the-adjudicated-query-pattern/",
  "sourceTitle": "Sweep thousands of leases for compliance using Amazon Quick and the Adjudicated Query pattern",
  "sourceBodyHash": "dd4ac38443ef7d5ca9e8ff4c51ed43e59470d239996f453f0b57d8f776d91cf7",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-02T23:14:49.110280Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T02:20:15.741826Z",
  "totalBlocks": 143,
  "translatedBlocks": 142,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9968ef51286710d7",
      "translationZh": "检查数以万计的公寓租赁合同，以应对不断变化的州房东-租客法律，并证明您实际上已经检查了所有合同，这对大多数合规团队来说是遥不可及的。但借助 Amazon Quick 中的生成式 AI，并配合合适的后端，这现在成为可能。在这篇文章中，我们介绍了一种称为 Adjudicated Query 的设计模式。业务用户可以使用它在聊天界面（Amazon Quick）中提出合规问题，而实际的通过/失败决策仍然停留在确定性的（非 AI）规则引擎中。我们将逐步讲解实现该模式的 AWS 参考架构，并部署一个可端到端运行的工作示例。该模式同样适用于其他高风险合规领域（如制裁筛选、保险理赔裁决、出口管制），但租赁合规作为我们的具体示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "29e1b33c567c0a9e",
      "translationZh": "规模下的合规挑战",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a248df769d9870f9",
      "translationZh": "投资组合运营商在多个州持有 50,000 份租赁合同。每个州都会发布房东-租客法规（滞纳金上限、通知期限、押金限额），这些法规的变更遵循立法机构的时间表，而非运营商的时间表。当法规发生变更时，负责合规的团队必须确定哪些租赁合同现在不符合要求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65fe257cd5b88054",
      "translationZh": "在数据量较小时，法律助理会阅读租赁合同。答案值得信赖，因为有人类站在其后。超过一定阈值后，这种做法就不可能了。工作转移到软件，随之出现一个新问题：答案如今只是屏幕上的一个数字，没有人能够独立验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6eb25ce0f3c0c72",
      "translationZh": "从这一现实中衍生出两个属性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b310b63e2c3a0166",
      "translationZh": "可证明的完整性：类似 “我们已经检查了全部 22,910 份德克萨斯州租赁合同” 的声明必须真实且可证明。从未评估的记录应报告为未评估，而不是被静默遗漏。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b6f07550d286872",
      "translationZh": "可防御性：某项发现可能在数月后的诉讼、审计或监管检查中受到质疑。为其辩护意味着要知道应用了哪条规则的哪个版本，作用于哪段条款文本，采用了何种方法，发生在何时，以及由谁完成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d69c7f75ff71062c",
      "translationZh": "这两个属性正是区别于企业搜索的问题所在。检索增强生成（RAG）解决了可访问性差距，但无法满足这两个属性中的任意一个。相似性搜索没有一个阈值能够表示“全部”。排名样本永远不知道它遗漏了什么。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "957b1af8a73c883f",
      "translationZh": "Text-to-SQL 缩小了这一差距，但带来了一个类别级别的风险：一个幻觉谓词可能会静默地减少人口数量，即使范围错误，结果数字看起来也是精确的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "29d475bdcd741e89",
      "translationZh": "Adjudicated Query 模式如何解决它",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a887def09fddb41",
      "translationZh": "Adjudicated Query 模式是一个确定性规则引擎之上的有界对话层。模型只做两件事：将自然语言问题翻译为对一组固定类型化操作的调用，并叙述返回的结果。它从不编写查询，从不修正人口，也不进行判定。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f1ea1187a72e74b",
      "translationZh": "在边界后面是一个规则引擎。规则是版本化的数据，而不是代码。引擎知道通用比较运算符（gte, lte, equals, exists），并且不包含命名管辖权或主题的分支。法律变更是一行规则书的编辑，而不是代码部署。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b2f8341e4201508",
      "translationZh": "每次合规扫描都会产生一个完整性收据：一个断言的不变量，其中合规 + 违规 + 模糊 + 不可读必须等于已扫描。这是从计数得出的，并在任何持久化之前断言。无法解释其人口的运行永远不会完成。没有任何路径可以让记录被静默跳过。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4945c60ff7483d32",
      "translationZh": "对话界面承载计数、收据和标记样本。完整的结果集（可能有数万行）驻留在仪表板界面上，读取相同的数据存储，可按记录钻取。这种分离意味着模型永远不会概括掉保证。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f51ad2ee08aa2b58",
      "translationZh": "为什么不用 RAG 或 Text-to-SQL？",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b4843e908b67d2d",
      "translationZh": "语义检索",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69052dc697c7b1db",
      "translationZh": "生成的查询（文本转SQL）",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7eacacb03513e5fb",
      "translationZh": "规则引擎 + BI（无聊天功能）",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0774d1b251aef20a",
      "translationZh": "裁决查询模式在不牺牲保证的前提下，为规则引擎和商业智能（BI）方法增加了自然语言访问。当负有责任的用户需要对话式访问，且漏掉记录是一种负债而非轻微的不便时，这是正确的选择。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4125fb730e2b4ce7",
      "translationZh": "参考架构",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c702a775cda94a83",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了组件如何端到端地协同工作。合规官与 Amazon Quick 中的两个界面进行交互：一个用于提问的聊天代理，以及一个用于浏览完整结果集的 Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板。聊天代理首先从 Amazon Cognito 获取 OAuth 令牌。然后，它通过 Amazon API Gateway HTTP API 发送 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 请求，API Gateway 在将请求转发到 AWS Lambda 函数之前会验证令牌。Lambda 函数托管 MCP 服务器和规则引擎，通过 RDS Data API 读取和写入 Amazon Aurora Serverless v2，并且仅在探索性子句搜索路径中调用 Amazon Bedrock。Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板通过虚拟私有云 (VPC) 连接直接读取同一个 Aurora 存储库。因此，两个界面都从同一个存储库读取，这就是使完整性收据成为单一事实来源的原因。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "853afbd33c90e5df",
      "translationZh": "图 1：裁决查询模式的参考架构",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5ebe94ac3e37a44",
      "translationZh": "两个界面都读取同一个存储库。聊天代理携带完整性收据和指向仪表板的链接。仪表板携带数据量，因为 10,800 行无法在聊天消息中渲染。Amazon Bedrock 仅由探索性操作从 AWS Lambda 调用。合规扫描不涉及任何模型，Amazon Aurora Serverless v2 也不调用模型。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0eaa2d2f7f82f9b",
      "translationZh": "有界操作界面",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0027a8375046f466",
      "translationZh": "MCP服务器正好暴露了六个工具，每个工具都有独特的语义：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09517c280a21a5b6",
      "translationZh": "针对特定日期生效的规则进行详尽的总体普查",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d0b964cbe064ae7",
      "translationZh": "官方模式。计算收据中包含的每笔租赁。记录发现结果",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95ebf32ca886481a",
      "translationZh": "在批准的基准上用建议值测试一条规则",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "034eec984141c0e4",
      "translationZh": "探索性模式。仅进行方向性计数。不记录任何内容",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b83580b1de1d334",
      "translationZh": "在筛选后的总体中按语义相似度获取Top K",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9551d1c6b510b5d",
      "translationZh": "解释性模式。一个排序列表。无法回答“多少”",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f37608a77a8939c",
      "translationZh": "单个发现结果的完整证据链",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cff8e448d2169720",
      "translationZh": "深入查看单个判定",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d19392755de4700d",
      "translationZh": "某日期生效的规则手册，包含版本、引用、批准人",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2472abf03d7adf14",
      "translationZh": "存活检查，不接触任何数据",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcb0c3dd23b3a849",
      "translationZh": "这个有界表面消除了生成查询的静默缩小风险。因为模型只能从一组固定操作中选择，其填充逻辑由人编写、审查和测试，所以它无法组合出错误的填充。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70a0a01d11dc4dd1",
      "translationZh": "关键架构组件",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4cd8e66d8b5b7aa",
      "translationZh": "通过 Amazon Quick 对话界面和代理编排层，您可以提出自然语言合规问题，Amazon Quick 聊天代理将其转换为对有界 MCP 操作表面的调用。Amazon Quick 通过 Amazon Cognito 使用 OAuth 2LO 向 MCP 服务器进行身份验证，并处理工具发现和响应叙述。确定性引擎处理合规逻辑。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92dd90f4a8dd8b4d",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Aurora Serverless v2 (Postgres + pgvector) 将规则手册、租约记录、提取状态、判定和运行存储在单个关系型存储中。将所有内容放在一个数据库中，使得完整性收据成为 SQL 计数，这是一种使中心保证可检查的高效方式。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d56f3abf1622349a",
      "translationZh": "AWS Lambda 托管 MCP 服务器（通过可流式 HTTP 进行 JSON-RPC 2.0，使用服务器发送事件帧进行响应，这是 Amazon Quick 客户端所要求的）和规则引擎。有界操作通过将规则值绑定为参数来转换为基于集合的 SQL。没有自然语言到达查询层。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14f88b1c0ba66732",
      "translationZh": "Amazon API Gateway HTTP API 通过由 Amazon Cognito 提供支持的 JSON Web Token (JWT) 授权者提供前端入口。不存在未认证的路由。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aaea6c1d382be242",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Cognito 通过两步式（客户端凭据）流程颁发 OAuth 令牌。客户端密钥在注册时从 Amazon Cognito 读取，而不会写入磁盘。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e21a948009b3ed0",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 仅支持探索路径，使用 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 ( amazon.titan-embed-text-v2:0 ) 进行语义相似度排名，并使用通过跨区域推理配置文件调用的 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 5 进行定性条款评估。它不用于官方合规性确定。Amazon Bedrock 模型可用性（包括 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 和 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 5）因 AWS 区域而异，因此在部署前请确认您的区域中可用这些模型。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7d03f7f277b8a96",
      "translationZh": "Amazon QuickSight 通过 VPC 连接连接到 Aurora，并渲染完整的发现表，该表可按扫描和严重性级别进行筛选，且行中已包含做出确定所需的所有列。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "03cfbb5c82a2dd5f",
      "translationZh": "不可协商的设计规则",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d5a5aa804ca5aaa",
      "translationZh": "规则即数据。法律变更即规则书中的一行。引擎不包含特定司法管辖区的分支。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa43d30b20aa909a",
      "translationZh": "没有自然语言接触 SQL。操作员选择固定的 SQL 模板。规则值作为参数绑定。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f6cc34606a81f98",
      "translationZh": "AI 之前是确定性的。数值比较回答扫描。不咨询任何模型。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2cd128ba9448589",
      "translationZh": "为了完整性进行精确过滤，仅用向量进行排序。相似度从不决定成员资格。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b5402f7ef2fee5a",
      "translationZh": "凭证是计算得出的，而非手工编写。在执行扫描提交之前，会先断言不变量。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c40af9ce585f8ca8",
      "translationZh": "无法读取的文档会被命名，而不是被丢弃。每个租约都会落入恰好一个桶中。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd7b49501758ed03",
      "translationZh": "发现结果仅支持追加写入。代码库中不存在针对发现结果的更新或删除操作。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "329137bff0a4a7ac",
      "translationZh": "将总结模型视为不受信任的渲染器",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c699bca2416898e",
      "translationZh": "有一个设计元素值得单独设立一节，因为它看起来有些陌生：旨在抵御聊天模型改写的工程防护措施。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a1fa5cde18b3ab2",
      "translationZh": "将模型排除在决策路径之外，但将其重新放回交付路径，会在链路的末端重新引入风险。在实践中，我们观察到：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cae33f48efec3ca1",
      "translationZh": "一个模型剥离了一个警告前缀。在改写过程中，一个说明性引用标签被移除，随后模型将一个虚构的引用呈现为法规。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a22b4b12b5a749d",
      "translationZh": "从样本外推得到的模型。给定20行预览数据，模型推断出一个在整体数据中并不存在的全体范围。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff5f196a58218c37",
      "translationZh": "三种技术可以解决此问题：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7dbe3539b7fbafb",
      "translationZh": "将短语的注意事项以不可去除的方括号后缀形式重复出现在多个负载层级中，而不是作为可移除的元数据标签出现。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4460a6dc93affbdd",
      "translationZh": "提供能够让诚实答案变得容易的数据。对每条记录进行真实的聚合计算，并将结果交给模型。拥有真实数值的模型无需从样本中猜测。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20a570ba44d17107",
      "translationZh": "在多个结构层级（字段、字符串、摘要）中使用重复模式标签，以确保至少有一个在改写时仍然保留。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5f937853beeda73",
      "translationZh": "原则：负载中的安全措施只有在能够经受改写时才算强大。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "56b5c2577cd08131",
      "translationZh": "部署并运行示例",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fca041d9c3b8c61a",
      "translationZh": "完整的参考实现已在 GitHub 上提供。它附带合成数据（不包含真实客户租约数据）、确定性的语料库生成，以及针对已部署堆栈的验收测试。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f762af3582902c35",
      "translationZh": "在部署之前，请确认您已经具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b005ea4ca5578086",
      "translationZh": "在美国东部（北弗吉尼亚）地区（us-east-1），拥有已启用 Amazon Bedrock 模型访问权限的 AWS 账户，可使用 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 和 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 5。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3aaaa8f7afc82741",
      "translationZh": "已配置凭证的 AWS 命令行界面（AWS CLI）v2（应能够成功运行 aws sts get-caller-identity）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b547614e63280e95",
      "translationZh": "Node.js 24 用于 AWS 云开发工具包（AWS CDK）CLI。mise 是可选的，仅用于部署 Node 24。您可以通过任意方式安装 Node 24（Node 18 已经停止支持 CDK）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0d4a66f26efaa280",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：克隆仓库",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baceb370446ac47f",
      "translationZh": "克隆示例仓库并设置 Python 环境：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a05ff83189356b58",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：部署基础设施",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85c077e7b2c37499",
      "translationZh": "如果尚未完成，请先引导 CDK（Bootstrap CDK），然后部署堆栈。Aurora 的资源配置通常需要约 11 分钟，具体耗时会因账户和区域而异。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfbf865df0ff9f86",
      "translationZh": "CDK 版本固定为 2.261.0，以匹配 requirements.txt。该堆栈部署如下：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3fb608a6f83dc64b",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Cognito（2LO 客户端）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1daa53a7531fe8a7",
      "translationZh": "Amazon API Gateway 与 JWT 授权器。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2235fb9feade2485",
      "translationZh": "AWS Lambda（MCP 服务器 + 规则引擎）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41d79190375f43d7",
      "translationZh": "亚马逊 Aurora Serverless v2。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb17b6b21e3548a7",
      "translationZh": "亚马逊 Quick Sight 网络连接。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b326fe024a4e340e",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：播种数据和验证",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7d528804ad034cb",
      "translationZh": "按顺序运行迁移、语料库生成、摄取和亚马逊 Quick Sight 设置脚本：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "946ab0e0cac78852",
      "translationZh": "语料库是确定性的，因此重建的堆栈会重现相同的结果。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2bddd3ce3d6ff35c",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：在亚马逊 Quick 中注册 MCP 集成",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22088a4596a3af47",
      "translationZh": "亚马逊 Quick 在注册时快照工具列表。亚马逊 Quick 不会检测到新工具或重命名的工具，直到您删除并重新创建集成。仅部署 Lambda 是不够的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa162bb4497ff878",
      "translationZh": "从您的部署输出中打印注册输入：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "018dfea976a41114",
      "translationZh": "每次从 Amazon Cognito 读取客户端密钥（不写入磁盘）。在您的输出中使用 Issuer URL 中的用户池 ID：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d098810f5bf5731",
      "translationZh": "然后在 Amazon Quick 中：Connectors > Create for your team > Model Context Protocol。先删除任何现有条目，然后使用这些值创建一个新条目（OAuth client-credentials/2LO）。将客户端密钥直接复制到 Amazon Quick 中，而不是复制到文件或 shell 变量中。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7e144b5b34ea30d3",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：验证集成",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2212017a322ac3bb",
      "translationZh": "按此顺序验证端到端部署：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "885bf60e63dc3435",
      "translationZh": "验收套件证明服务器正常工作。下一节将演练 Amazon Quick 聊天体验，以确认 Amazon Quick 选择了正确的工具。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "51b7dc78890aa324",
      "translationZh": "演练体验",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e37ec9c40dfcde6",
      "translationZh": "随着堆栈已部署并验证，您现在可以从 Amazon Quick 聊天运行合规性扫描并检查结果。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3b1cca642de34a1",
      "translationZh": "提出一个合规性问题",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a5dddc338fd9378",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 聊天中，输入：“哪些德克萨斯州的租赁违反了滞纳金上限？使用 01/01/2026 生效的规则。”",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38e53c25c7389aa4",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 将此识别为合规性扫描，并选择 sweep_compliance 工具。该工具针对人口中的每一份德克萨斯州租赁进行详尽检查，应用指定日期生效的规则。确定过程中不涉及模型。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec67d17bfc3ad147",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 播报结构化结果。图 2 显示了聊天回复：表格中非合规发现的一个简短样本，以计数形式呈现的完整性收据，合成数据警告，以及打开完整仪表板的链接。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7630d556a7d5693",
      "translationZh": "图 2：带有完整性收据和发现样本的 Amazon Quick 聊天回复",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "418412333c4b36ed",
      "translationZh": "回复包括非合规发现样本和以计数形式呈现的完整性收据：10,111 违规，689 模糊，20 不可读。它还包括合成数据警告和进入 Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板的链接。它故意不尝试渲染所有 10,111 行。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2d3fa5b1ee14b5e",
      "translationZh": "通过检查不变量来验证完整性收据：合规 + 违约 + 模糊 + 不可读应等于总扫描人口。在此示例中，计数总和等于德克萨斯州租赁总人口，确认每条记录都落入恰好一个桶中。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a94686e185ee9adc",
      "translationZh": "在仪表板上检查完整人口",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "562e2b54056a6aca",
      "translationZh": "跟随聊天回复中的仪表板链接打开 Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板。图 3 显示了发现选项卡，其中扫描中的每一对租赁规则都作为自己的行出现，并附带完整的证据链。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4df9883bd36234df",
      "translationZh": "图 3：Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板列出扫描中的所有发现",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6220ef927bf1e339",
      "translationZh": "仪表板显示扫描的所有发现，每行对应一个租约-规则对。使用严重性分段过滤器来隔离违规的发现。每行包含租约ID、触发的规则、提取的值以及期望的值。按规则排序可将相关违规分组，并识别整个资产组合中的模式。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbe5bfcc1f6c7d20",
      "translationZh": "深入单一发现",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5615463bd1ac83f0",
      "translationZh": "选择一行会打开查找详情。图 4 显示了单个查找，其中一侧是逐字租约条款，另一侧是触发的规则，包括其版本、引用以及比较的数值。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8fc89eba708e649",
      "translationZh": "图 4：显示租约条款以及触发的规则的详细信息",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9bd1c65ab1d2b67",
      "translationZh": "这就是可防御性在实践中的表现。该发现显示了提取的数值（7%滞纳金）、要求的数值（5%上限）以及规则引用（德克萨斯州《财产法典》第92章B分节，修订后自2026-01-01生效）。所有这些都与租约条款的原文并列展示，因此无需重新构建。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "675fb64be8ed2dc8",
      "translationZh": "测试额外的路由路径",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb001cf967d8ddad",
      "translationZh": "通过测试剩余的操作，确认 Amazon Quick 能够将路由指向正确的工具。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e805ceda9fec5f1b",
      "translationZh": "“查找类似于责任豁免的德克萨斯条款。”（应调用 explore_clauses）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e6916f95a33eb44",
      "translationZh": "“如果德克萨斯州的滞纳金上限降至3%会怎样？”（should invoke simulate_rule_change）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cac7b5f4ca68b6d5",
      "translationZh": "为避免持续费用，请在完成后销毁堆栈：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90b4085a345e9412",
      "translationZh": "Aurora Serverless v2 可以扩展到 0 Aurora Capacity Units（ACU），并在一段时间不活动后自动暂停（参见 Amazon Aurora 定价）。此示例故意设置了一个小的非零最小容量，因为暂停的集群会给会话的第一个问题带来恢复延迟。未部署 NAT 网关。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc8491d133fd689d",
      "translationZh": "如果您计划稍后返回堆栈，但希望在会话之间最小化成本，请在 infra/stack.py 中将 serverless_v2_min_capacity 设置为 0 并重新部署，以启用零规模（scale-to-zero）和自动暂停（auto-pause）。在集群暂停后，首次查询时会出现短暂的恢复延迟。由于语料库是确定性的，完全销毁后重新部署的堆栈会产生相同的结果。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f5f32725b9a50b2c",
      "translationZh": "安全性考虑",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d133d0fb8ea6ad9a",
      "translationZh": "由于此模式是为合规工作而构建的，安全性是设计的一部分，而不是后期添加的功能。示例遵循了以下实践，在进行适配之前，您应当根据自身需求逐一审查这些实践。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5016387b8ef9fef",
      "translationZh": "密钥处理。Amazon Cognito 客户端密钥在注册时读取，且不会写入磁盘或提交到源代码管理。仅在 Amazon Quick 连接器配置中存储，并按照常规计划进行轮换。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2c837b3d3261cb3",
      "translationZh": "最小权限模型访问。AWS Lambda 执行角色仅授予 Amazon Bedrock InvokeModel 权限，用于示例所使用的特定 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 和 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 5 模型 ARN，而不是对所有模型的通配符。在您自己的构建中，以相同的方式限定 AWS 身份和访问管理 (IAM) 权限。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a82e632cf14f87a",
      "translationZh": "数据路径的网络隔离。Amazon Quick Sight 通过 VPC 连接而不是公共端点访问 Amazon Aurora Serverless v2，数据库安全组仅允许预期的源。将存储保持在公共互联网之外。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce3d9718addd4545",
      "translationZh": "查询路径中不包含自然语言。规则引擎仅从固定的操作符到模板表组装 SQL，规则值作为参数绑定，这消除了模型编写的查询所创建的注入表面。这既是安全属性，也是正确性属性。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3598c7736bb1362a",
      "translationZh": "可审计、仅追加的发现。发现是仅追加的，代码库中没有 UPDATE 或 DELETE 路径，因此合规记录不能在事后被静默更改。每个决定都携带其证据链以供稍后审查。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ae84b10a2b886ad",
      "translationZh": "合成数据边界。示例附带合成租赁数据以及清晰标记的占位符规则和引用。在针对真实记录运行之前，完成贵组织的分类、访问审查以及任何规则内容的法律验证。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe4361619c3893ef",
      "translationZh": "扫描的人工归属。Amazon Quick 通过两步式（客户端凭据）流与 MCP 服务器进行机器对机器的身份验证，因此令牌标识的是 Amazon Quick 应用程序，而不是在聊天中提问的个人。引擎记录了决定的内容、规则版本、证据、方法和日期，但它不会接收要随发现一起存储的最终用户身份。对于可防御性的“由谁”部分，归属存在于 Amazon Quick 审计层，该层记录了哪个用户运行了哪个聊天操作。发现通过将其扫描 ID 和时间戳与该记录相关联，回溯到一个人。如果您需要在合规存储本身记录归属，请将 Amazon Quick 中的最终用户 ID 传递到工具调用中，并将其持久化到扫描行。然后，“谁”随发现一起传播，而不仅仅存在于 Amazon Quick 审计层。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "19ba2cc2d9ea9fb9",
      "translationZh": "何时使用此模式",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0497aa46bb9e129f",
      "translationZh": "仲裁查询模式适用于：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b61ced01e967ff92",
      "translationZh": "遗漏记录是一种责任，而非轻微的不便。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1813cbdcf448587b",
      "translationZh": "答案可能会在几个月后被不在场的人质疑。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f774e30f076b5a74",
      "translationZh": "治理逻辑由外部拥有，并按自身时间表变更。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33d961d55120e8f9",
      "translationZh": "记录主体是可枚举的（您可以列出问题所涵盖的每条记录）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4e4eb272fe8b381",
      "translationZh": "该描述涵盖了许多领域。示例包括租赁合规、保险索赔裁决、制裁筛查、出口管制、临床试验方案监控、建筑规范检查、财务报告控制测试以及凭证验证。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0217f7c4aee8a4cc",
      "translationZh": "当合理的答案就足够且用户可以重新提问时，RAG 是更简单的选择。Text-to-SQL 适用于能够验证生成的查询并容忍偶尔错误结果的团队。如果负责任的用户可以接受没有对话层的仪表板，请考虑直接使用规则引擎加 BI：它以更低的成本提供相同的保证。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d717e404e73b0708",
      "translationZh": "当这是错误的选择时",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5db1ff5697108803",
      "translationZh": "该模式很重：规则引擎、有界的工具表面以及完整性证明。这种机制只有在解决正确的问题时才能发挥作用，将其应用于错误的问题只会增加成本而不增加信任。请在三种情况下避免使用该模式。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c09caea775d39658",
      "translationZh": "规则实际上并不是确定性的。当合规性是简单的比较时，该模式有效，例如费用小于或等于上限，或通知期大于或等于所需天数。当调用是真正的判断时，例如条款是否显失公平或披露是否充分，强行将其纳入此模式会将规则编写中的主观性隐藏起来，并使结果看起来精确，但实际上并非如此。对于这些决定，应保持人在回路中，而不是将其伪装成确定性的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1202be0612f8a950",
      "translationZh": "完整性对这个问题并不重要。如果用户只需要几个代表性示例，或者是在探索而不是裁决，那么完整性收据对于他们不需要的保证来说就是多余的。RAG 是针对这类问题的更简单、正确的答案。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "850f0429ef167a6c",
      "translationZh": "总体本身是模糊的。收据证明您覆盖了总体中的每条记录，而不是总体是正确的。如果“所有德克萨斯州租赁”的定义本身就有争议，那么保证就是针对错误的分母。在依赖收据之前，请确保总体可以通过精确、可辩护的谓词来提取。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "462da6c20843b7b8",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们介绍了裁决查询模式，并演示了它如何通过 Amazon Quick 对话界面提供可证明完整、可辩护的合规答案。该模式将受限的 MCP 操作表面与确定性规则引擎配对，因此模型负责翻译问题和叙述结果，但不涉及产生保证的决定。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87732c166c485f44",
      "translationZh": "通过部署示例堆栈，在 Amazon Quick 聊天中提出合规问题，并通过 Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板跟踪结果，您从头到尾走完了整个模式。完整性收据涵盖了每条记录，发现结果携带了完整的证据链，而分面交付通过改写保持了保证的完整性。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62aade757680ff6a",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请克隆示例仓库，部署堆栈，在 Amazon Quick 中注册 MCP 集成，并尝试提出您的第一个合规问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97c8607c5e1f475e",
      "translationZh": "模型上下文协议",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
